  "diagnosis": "Generated descriptions frequently predict dramatic escalations (court rulings, nationalizations, arbitration) that do not match the more incremental or divergent true next news, indicating a tendency to overestimate conflict severity and invent specific outcomes while ignoring shifts in topic or tone.",
